---
import GithubMark from '#site/components/GithubMark.astro'
import SiteFooter from '#site/components/SiteFooter.astro'
import SiteHeader from '#site/components/SiteHeader.astro'
import BaseLayout from '#site/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
    title="About Pruftnet"
    description="Where Pruftnet comes from, who builds it, and how the project is developed in the open."
    path="/about"
>
    <SiteHeader />
    <main class="page py-16 md:py-24">
        <article class="max-w-2xl">
            <p class="label">About</p>
            <h1 class="display text-foreground mt-5 text-[clamp(2.5rem,1.6rem+3.6vw,4.5rem)]">
                A packet analyzer, built in the open.
            </h1>

            <div class="text-muted-foreground mt-12 space-y-12 text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed">
                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-foreground text-xl font-semibold">How it started</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3">
                        Pruftnet began as an academic project at the Technische Hochschule Nürnberg and
                        grew into an open-source tool for network engineers, security researchers and
                        anyone who wants to understand what crosses their network.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-3">
                        Version 0.2 is a rewrite. The capture engine moved to a native C++ worker that
                        writes every packet to disk before analysis, so the application can account for
                        each one. The earlier 0.1 generation, with its topology graph and workflow
                        builder, remains available in the <a class="link text-foreground" href="/archive">archive</a>.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-foreground text-xl font-semibold">Who builds it</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3">
                        Pruftnet is created and maintained by Wilson Tenepo, a software developer with
                        more than six years of experience building applications, currently at Siemens AG.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm">
                        <a class="link text-foreground inline-flex items-center gap-2" href="https://github.com/franktronics">
                            <GithubMark class="size-4" /> franktronics
                        </a>
                        <a class="link text-foreground" href="https://x.com/franktronics_w">X: @franktronics_w</a>
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-foreground text-xl font-semibold">Open source</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3">
                        The code is released under the MIT License. Issues, ideas and pull requests are
                        welcome on <a class="link text-foreground" href="https://github.com/franktronics/pruftnet.app">GitHub</a>.
                    </p>
                </section>
            </div>
        </article>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
